sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Customer / Browser
    participant Client as React SPA (Frontend)
    participant API as Express API Server
    participant Auth as JWT Auth Middleware
    participant Controller as Order Controller
    participant Model as Mongoose ODM
    participant DB as MongoDB Database

    User->>Client: Clicks "Place Order"
    Client->>Client: Retrieves JWT token & cart items from localStorage
    Client->>API: POST /api/orders (Bearer JWT + order payload)
    API->>Auth: Verify Authorization Header
    alt Token Invalid or Missing
        Auth-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized
        Client-->>User: Redirect to Login screen
    else Token Valid
        Auth->>API: Attach req.user (id, email, role)
        API->>Controller: createOrder(req, res)
        Controller->>Model: Validate stock & recalculate pricing
        Model->>DB: Query Product collection (price & countInStock)
        DB-->>Model: Product documents
        Controller->>Model: Create new Order document
        Model->>DB: Insert Order into 'orders' collection
        DB-->>Model: Saved Order document with _id
        Controller-->>API: 201 Created (JSON Order object)
        API-->>Client: HTTP 201 Response
        Client->>Client: Clear Cart state in CartContext
        Client-->>User: Navigate to /#/order-success with receipt
    end
